// ============================================================================
//  tmrLeaf.OnTimerEnd  —  dismisses the leaf-wipe transition overlay.
//
//  PLACEMENT: one Timer "tmrLeaf" on EACH screen that shows imgLeafWipe
//  (scrDashboard + scrPortal):
//    Duration = 1100        (matches the leaf-wipe animation length, ms)
//    Repeat   = false
//    AutoStart= false
//    Start    = varLeafBusy   <-- runs whenever a transition is armed
//    Reset    = !varLeafBusy
//    Visible  = false
//  OnTimerEnd (below) clears the flag, which hides imgLeafWipe and resets the timer.
//
//  Note: this dismiss relies on a timer tick. The NAVIGATION itself never depends
//  on it (Navigate + ScreenTransition.Cover/UnCover already ran in the button), so
//  if timers are unreliable in your Power BI visual you can simply set
//  imgLeafWipe.Visible=false and keep the built-in Cover/UnCover transition.
// ============================================================================
Set( varLeafBusy, false )
